              '</table>\n'
              '<section class="warn">\n'
              '  <p><strong>This is not a clinical report.</strong> It was produced by a\n'
              '  final-year student project for research and education. It has not been\n'
              '  clinically validated, and no qualified clinical expert has reviewed the\n'
              '  explanatory text on this page.</p>\n'
              '  <p>Recommendation text on this page is quoted from published CPIC guidance via\n'
              '  PharmCAT. Automated source checks are not human review: they cannot show that\n'
              '  every statement here is supported, or that any of it is correct for the person\n'
              '  this sample came from.</p>\n'
              '  <p>Do not change a medicine on the strength of this page. Take it to a\n'
              '  qualified healthcare professional.</p>\n'
              '</section>\n'
              '<h2>Results</h2>\n'
              '<p class="note">Ordered by consequence, not alphabetically.</p>\n'
              '<article class="result">\n'
              '<div class="head"><span class="drug mono">codeine</span><span class="verdict">Unknown</span></div>\n'
              '<table class="kv"><tr><td>gene</td><td class="mono">CYP2D6</td></tr><tr><td>diplotype</td><td class="mono">*2/*2</td></tr><tr><td>phenotype</td><td class="mono">PM</td></tr><tr><td>evidence level</td><td class="mono">A</td></tr></table>\n'
